      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stollings%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community was founded in 1900 on five hundred acres of land originally purchased for timber operations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/stollings_west_virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Industrial growth in Stollings accelerated after the Chesapeake and Ohio Railroad reached the area in 1904, unlocking vast coal reserves.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
